  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ad0ccf50e4689e77442cab3f6f03ec1cfb14f5f27dfa7580689b525527068bdb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcoastn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鳞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......壳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多一点，再多一点......塞满嘴巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捡起来，吞下去。更多一点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带走。带回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带回去。塞满身体。塞到塞不下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟姐妹们，尽情享受你们的早餐吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是对善行的奖赏，只因饥渴与病痛并未击溃我们，而是令我们更加真挚，更加团结，更加友爱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种长篇大论的表演，从一个城市到另一个城市，你竟不觉得腻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何为表演？将祂的伟岸与仁爱带到陆上，令无知者领受，我本就乐意之至。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们什么都听不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的海洋将一视同仁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，兄弟，将你手上这块鳞肉分享给你受苦的兄弟。你要相信，舍下这一小块，他的满足会使得你的心灵愈加满足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你，你应同你的兄弟道谢，感激他舍下他本可以拥有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你俩站在一起，手握着手，足抵着足，共享彼此的性命，自此你们将更伟大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_189",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢......教士......老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乖孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "约定并不在你与它之间。而是他们和它，经你的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "约定？不，约定是双向的，这些受苦的人还不足以令大海有所求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们请求，大海给予回应。而我帮助他们，令他们的声音能被听见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你既然已将自己当作我们的一部分，你自然清楚规则。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请原谅我的生疏。我可以换上更恰切的措辞——你将他们的血肉筑成通路，从而在教会内部获得你想要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论怎么说，你没必要每次现身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎知我要什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高人一等的快感很容易使人沉溺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谬误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身为海的最虔心的造物，我的地位并非伪妄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我站在这里，只是因我发自真心想救他们。若是没有我，他们早就化成了这陆上的一滩滩肮脏腐肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "疾病，饥饿，这些具体的敌人，如果还能对抗，便不是最深的苦难。最深的苦难来自人心灵的深处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当人们发现灾难已无法对抗，他们无论做什么都将把自己引向不可避免的衰亡，这才是真正苦难到来之时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像这样的城镇，伊比利亚还有多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这片庞大的国土早已支撑不起人们对它的诉求，这里的人与人却依旧困缩在各自逼仄的皮囊内，或彼此隔绝，或互相争斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您对伊比利亚的关心令人赞叹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又错了。我在意人们的苦，而非区区陆上的国境线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人都是如此，不是么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "囿于自身肉体的限制，难以凭自己的力量打开对自我和对族类的执着，一味地选择对抗而非理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样下去，再强大的个体都免不了被逐个击破，苦难终将吞噬每一个角落。你也曾见证，你也曾动摇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对我说这些，真的有必要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许我说的还不够多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真知总是值得传述，无论听者是否愚钝如你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或者，看在这段时间的共事之情份上，不如将这段话作为消磨等待时间的小小娱乐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的言语技巧的确非同凡响。难怪沉迷的人这么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你仍然无法理解。我比真诚更真诚。我对他们并无诉求，我亦不相信强迫的力量，我只想向他们指出一种新的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身体的弱小将永远限制他们的认知。你以为我是在通过言语诱使他们心灵信服，恰恰相反。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是在令他们的心灵听从身体最基本的诉求。圣人的训导能带来的不过是一时的盲信，肉身的强大才能令他们有资格亲眼看见更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海里有些生物。它们没有眼睛，身体微小，无法游动，只能随着潮汐漂荡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们见到的大海，与我们见到的有多大区别？没有眼睛的生物又何从领会大海的神圣与深邃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你与你的同僚，你们不知从何处谋取了这层卑劣却坚硬的皮囊。你们看不见这些弱小的正如何挣扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "试问谁才是真正的傲慢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是正在帮助他们的我，还是那些借着危难扩张，利用言语、将真正的绝望替换成虚假的希望，欺瞒、控制悲惨弱者，从而盗取权柄的伪神教徒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或者——是从来不愿意正视海底的愚蠢的你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我将我看见的分享予他们，令他们打开视野，知晓自己仍有真实的希望。他们自己选择，是同陆地一起衰朽，还是随大海走向新生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种可能性将不仅能将他们从饥饿病痛的绝境中解救，同样也是大海对僵持着耗损着的陆地的慷慨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这并非征服，而是理解，是容纳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我向他们指出了路，带给他们好的生活，最终引他们如我一样走向真理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这便是我伟大的事业。你错误的皮囊困住了你的心灵，令你短视，看不见真正的伟大。我将原谅你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵。或许沉迷的不止有他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，歌手，我们差点来晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多吃的......大家都好饿，可算有吃的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一、二、三......这些，带回去，弄碎了，煮汤给佩特拉奶奶喝。今晚喝这个，好不好啊，小长凳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......嗷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不要直接吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "壳太硬了，会把你的牙弄坏。回去煮软了再吃呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌手，你也拿一些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌、歌手？你还愣着干什么呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢些吃，兄弟，这些都是你的。往前看，这一整片，也终将都是你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，打开心灵，接受自己，拥抱他人，学会相信，懂得牺牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纷争早已终结，苦难也会远去。我们站在一起，我们的心灵、肉体与信仰都将愈发强韧，就如我们足下这片永恒的海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请容许我走远些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对近日某些......饮食消化不良。我或许会忍耐不住，吐在你脸上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——兄弟，你的贝壳掉了，让你的兄弟替你拿着吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真有趣。你今天心情不错。你甚至对我使用了这样的词句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随你怎么说，请便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来自大海的讯息令你振奋。你等不及我们的盛会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就去吧，去寻她。找到你的故交，将这份喜悦分享予她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过来。你看他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你闻到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的姿势不够优美。我教你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和你跳过几次舞，斯卡蒂？两次，还是三次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是个好舞伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很关心她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她现在还算安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "证据。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要那些无用的东西么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真怀疑陆上的日子磨坏了你的鼻子，猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你身上全是臭味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我比你更想吐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她确实和你在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你的鼻子还不算太坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好，你还没像一个哭哭啼啼的陆生幼崽一样，缠着我问个不停，问我为什么要带走她，又为什么在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "问问题从来不是我们的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道你还是不是我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你的心里还是有许多疑问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摸箱子）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不确定的话，还是不要动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否则，你就只是在给敌人机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的目标不是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你来这里，是想做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明明知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一直想找她。找到她，你的疑问就能消失吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的记忆坏了。她并不能告诉我什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞧瞧你的模样。也就比困在笼子里的好上那么一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我再教你一些，虽然你不是我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记住，猎人追逐猎物，而不是沉迷追逐本身。盲目的追逐只能带来心理安慰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已经软弱到渴望这些虚无的幻觉了吗，斯卡蒂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你多久没跳舞了？你走的路太多，你的皮肤很干燥。你也许已经遗忘了呼吸的节奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再问你一次。你来这里，是来做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不动手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们不是一起的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没那么在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在乎的是你。是你要解开心结，不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在和我装神弄鬼？他是什么人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我说了你就会信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcoastn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_178",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......呃呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢慢来，别摔倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听到了么？这海浪的身影。噗通，噗通，噗通，就像你我的心跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们食的、饮的皆是大海的馈赠。兄弟，你是否感觉到充沛的力量，正从口腹涌来，流通手脚，抵达心脏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拥抱你们面前的浩瀚吧！这是新生的希望！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，歌手呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一眨眼，她又不见了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。歌手认得路，她可能又去找她的同伴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们走吧，长凳，带上这些吃的，回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长凳，我好想唱歌。我们唱歌吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌手唱的歌。你还记得吗？你记得也没用。你连话都还不会说。这样吧，我唱给你听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的家乡在后♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的路在身前♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿......呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别挠我。唉。你觉得难听对不对？我也觉得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我比歌手差远啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，多唱几次，我也会唱好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼......他的路在身前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要走了。再不走他会起疑心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二队长！你到底在盘算什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是需要队友？你需要队友的话，为什么不说？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要么你是敌人？如果你是敌人，刚才我想用贝壳了结你的时候，你为什么没有反过来杀了我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先弄清楚自己要什么。彷徨的猎人连陷阱都辨别不出。不明不白地成为别人的收获，这是你想要的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌手，你的眼神，好像有点变了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你之前看我们的时候，和看那些海里来的怪物，都没什么区别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但现在，你愿意教我做海藻酒，还愿意为我们唱歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们和怪物，当然不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪物才不会缠着要我唱歌。怪物连说话都不会。它们通常又脏又蠢，只知道进食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......那些海里的怪物，它们会吃了我们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果它们饿的话，会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们爬上来，就和我们去海里一样，都是为了找吃的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你同情怪物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "饿着肚子，确实难受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给它们吃掉的人就不会这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......我也不想就这样被怪物吃掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前我没想过。现在，呃，我还想......再多听歌手唱一会儿歌。我还要教小长凳唱，就像佩特拉奶奶教会我的那么多事一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你可得和你奶奶一样，活久一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！至少现在，我一点都不担心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_180",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为......歌手，你还在这里，你会帮我们，砰砰砰把它们都打跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibcoastn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我的心跳，在加快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎。对。是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我毕竟还是个猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
